{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 46,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "God is our refuge and strength, a very present help in trouble.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神是我们的避难所，是我们的力量， 在患难中随时的帮助。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝是我們的避難所，是我們的力量， 在患難中隨時的幫助。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Therefore we won’t be afraid, though the earth changes, the mountains are shaken into the heart of the seas;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "所以，地虽改变，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "所以，地雖改變，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "though its waters roar and are troubled, the mountains tremble with their swelling.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "其中的水虽匉訇翻腾，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "其中的水雖匉訇翻騰，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "There is a river, the streams of which make the city of God glad, the holy place of the tents of the Most High.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有一道河，这河的分汊使 神的城欢喜；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有一道河，這河的分汊使上帝的城歡喜；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "God is within her. She shall not be moved. will help her at dawn.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神在其中，城必不动摇；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝在其中，城必不動搖；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The nations raged. The kingdoms were moved. He lifted his voice and the earth melted.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "外邦喧嚷，列国动摇；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "外邦喧嚷，列國動搖；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD of Armies is with us. The God of Jacob is our refuge.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "万军之耶和华与我们同在； 的 神是我们的避难所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "萬軍之耶和華與我們同在； 的上帝是我們的避難所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Come, see the LORD’s works, he has made on the earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们来看耶和华的作为，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們來看耶和華的作為，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "He makes wars cease to the end of the earth. He breaks the bow, and shatters the spear. He burns the chariots in the fire.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他止息刀兵，直到地极；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他止息刀兵，直到地極；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Be still, and know that I am God. I will be exalted among the nations. I will be exalted on the earth.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要休息，要知道我是 神！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要休息，要知道我是上帝！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD of Armies is with us. The God of Jacob is our refuge.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "万军之耶和华与我们同在； 的 神是我们的避难所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "萬軍之耶和華與我們同在； 的上帝是我們的避難所！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}